{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"16218","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:16218","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_69026","characterName":"ニトス・ジークフリード","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"69026","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"254796"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ニトス・ジークフリード","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"27"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"1200年前に魔族を単身で滅ぼした英雄ジークフリードとしてロウリィに召喚された。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"…しかし実態はスケベなおっぱい星人であり、挙句ロリコンの疑いがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらにショタでホモも疑われる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"召喚の期間2か月以内にB.B.ライダー（後述）に変身してシルバ達を倒すことが（ロウリィの）目標である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"召喚時の影響で記憶を失っており、自分の名前さえもわかっていない状態で"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"シルバと配下の十字八剣を相手にすることを強いられるが、その実力は高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最初は嫌々戦っていたが、いつしか自分からアークスやロウリィを守るため戦っていく。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"69026"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af78a72153ae23b569f89a0bfe243b351fc20c3a4eee5edec1a7e8d514c8f948.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8b374c3c99c2159ff3cb6d6383c0b2c01e607e22a91fc4abe7d7f76f9d88ef77.webp","width":48,"height":48,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_69027","characterName":"ロウリィ・ゴース","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"69027","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"254796"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ロウリィ・ゴース","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"12"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大都市アークスのゴース家のお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ロボットを開発できるくらいに頭はよく、ザコくらいなら片づけられるくらい結構すごい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"至ってわがままでありニトスやカロスはよく被害に遭うが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穴の深さを測る際に石代わりに落とされた挙句クッションにされる、高い塔から頭から落ちるなど"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインとして怪しい扱いを受けることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"シルバを倒そうとニトスを召喚するがその真意は…"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"69027"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c05b964d3be37cc8e27e138ad473cf9ce1b9803b9603f1f7c952bebe92185948.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/403e94234da46d9727347bc7da285b0800d84003f0d3b0d386fa52d3b90f4479.webp","width":48,"height":48,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_69028","characterName":"Silver","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"69028","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"254796"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Silver","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"おじいちゃんみたいな名前をしたロウリィが倒すべき敵。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"配下に十字八剣を抱えている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"69028"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/ae02f3289e81498e5fa04b853deca34f0aa4867202c55fe8199faad3db8e206b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/59612a402e7d1d2bbdc42772ccceba43f0e16db1fefafb0558f7b97f6cd72e05.webp","width":48,"height":48,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_69